[/tikz]
Find the length of rope $PQ$.

$PT$ and $PQ$ are tangents to the circle, centre $O$, and $\angle TPQ = \theta$.
$C$ is a point on the circle in the alternate segment for chord $TQ$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\usetikzlibrary{calc, decorations.markings}
\tikzset{tickmark/.style={postaction={decorate, decoration={markings, mark=at position 0.5 with {\draw[black] (0pt,-4pt) -- (0pt,4pt);}}}}}
